'''Gargu of Qym''' (Bacha Gargu TBD TBD ish Zhifol; born # MONTH {{abbr|2380|1977 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]]. He is the eldest son of [[Prince Kytoj of Qym|Prince Kytoj]], [[Bacha XVII of Qym|King Bacha XVII]]'s younger brother and, as such, is fourth in the [[line of succession to the Qymish throne]]. 

